    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Infer source regions for insular, montane, aquatic, marsh and cave lineages from dated phylogenies and ancestral ranges, then compare inferred sources with quantified dispersal accessibility and test for post-colonization trait shifts. Concordant accessible sources and derived local adaptations support the claim.";
