    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/assessmentType> "dataset-resolvability/0.1.0";
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/evidenceAgainst> "Accessibility is lineage- and time-dependent and requires substantial interpretation.", "Adaptation to the new home is not directly recorded for most lineages.", "Extinction and range shifts can erase source populations.";
